OL,3,GNEWSADemolition plans submitted for old
OL,4,AToys R Us site
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe partnership - a joint venture
OL,7,Fbetween Aviva Capital Partners,
OL,8,FSouthampton City Council and the
OL,9,FUniversity of Southampton Holdings -
OL,10,Fsaid the retained structure could have
OL,11,Ftemporary uses while longer-term plans
OL,12,Fare worked up.
OL,14,FIf approved, demolition and site
OL,15,Fpreparation work would begin next
OL,16,Fmonth.
